<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKH JULY COPPER OUTPUT RISES 3.0 PCT MTH/MTH.</title>
<headline>KAZAKH JULY COPPER OUTPUT RISES 3.0 PCT MTH/MTH.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan produced 26,738 tonnes of copper in July, up 3.0 percent from June, while zinc output fell by 2.1 percent in July from June to 16,082 tonnes, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures for non-ferrous metals production (all figures in tonnes).</p>
<p>			     July	   June	 Jan-July 97</p>
<p> Copper		    26,738	 25,947	  167,093</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change   +3.0	   -2.9		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change   +8.1	  +14.0	     -4.9</p>
<p> Zinc			16,082	 16,419	  106,513</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change   -2.1	   +3.4		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change  +18.1	  +15.4	    +11.7</p>
<p> Lead			 6,897	  5,824	   43,625</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change  +18.4	  -26.5		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr pct change     +6.0	  -10.5	    +13.1</p>
<p> Bauxite		  329,200	331.900	1,906,500</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change   -0.8	  +13.6		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change   +3.7	   +4.7	     +1.0</p>
<p> Alumina		   93,559	 89,177	  637,157</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change   +4.9	   -3.1		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change   -0.5	   +2.8	     +2.8</p>
<p> Titanium		   1.560	  1.505	   10.635</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change   +3.7	   -1.6		n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change  +54.5	  +33.0	    +57.6</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509 410</p>
</text>
